      "g": 255,
      "b": 255,
      "a": 255
    },
    "_string": "• Some symbols in reels 2, 3, 4, and/or 5 may occupy 2 to 4 symbol positions, and each of these symbols will be counted as a single symbol during payout calculations.\n\n• Wild symbol substitutes for all symbols except the Scatter symbol.\n\n• Wild symbol appears on reels 2, 3, 4, and 5 only.\n\n• The Free Spins Feature is played at the same bet size and bet level as the spin that triggered the Free Spins Feature.\n",
