    "_color": {
      "__type__": "cc.Color",
      "r": 255,
      "g": 255,
      "b": 255,
      "a": 255
    },
    "_string": "• During any spin, some symbols (excluding the Wild symbol and Scatter symbol) in reels 2, 3, 4, and/or 5 that occupy 2 to 4 symbol positions may have a silver frame around them.\n\n• At the start of every new round after the symbols have cascaded down, any silver-framed symbol that was involved in a win in the previous round will be transformed into a randomly selected symbol (other than the Wild symbol and Scatter symbol) with a gold frame around it.\n\n• At the start of every new round after the symbols have cascaded down, any gold-framed symbol that was involved in a win in the previous round will be transformed into a Wild symbol.\n",
    "_horizontalAlign": 0,
    "_verticalAlign": 0,
    "_actualFontSize": 35,
