    "_string": "• 4 Scatter symbols appearing anywhere will trigger the Free Spins Feature with 10 free spins. Each additional Scatter symbol will award 2 extra free spins.\n\n• At the start of the Free Spins Feature, the win multiplier is x2.\n\n• During any free spin, if there are one or more winning symbols on the reels, after wins are paid and the new symbols have cascaded down, the win multiplier will be increased by 2.\n\n• Free spins can be retriggered.\n",
