    "_string": "Spin\n\n• Tap to start a spin at the current Base Bet, Bet Size, and Bet Level.\n\n• Tap the button or the game area during a spin to stop the reels.\n\nPC Version Only\n\n• Press the <Space> key to start a spin at the current Base Bet, Bet Size, and Bet Level.\n\n• Press and hold the <Space> key to continue spinning until it is released.\n\n• When the reels are spinning, press the <Space> key to skip the reel spinning animation and reveal the results (subject to internet connection stability).\n\n• Whenever there is exactly one on-screen button available to press, press the <Space> key to activate the button.",
