    "_string": "More Settings\n\n• Tap to access additional settings.\n\nSound\n\n• Tap to turn the sound ON or OFF.\n\nPaytable\n\n• Shows winning combinations and payouts.\n\nRules\n\n• Shows the game rules and button functions.\n\nHistory\n\n• Shows details of previously played games. Scroll down to the end to load more records.\n\n• Tap the calendar icon to select the dates of games to be shown in History.\n\nClose\n\n• Tap to return to the Main Game.\n",
